    "study_id": "text3-3",
    "title": "Postoperative pain assessment of robotic nipple-sparing mastectomy with immediate prepectoral prosthesis breast reconstruction: a comparison with conventional nipple- sparing mastectomy",
    "authors": "Jiae Moon, Jeea Lee, Dong Won Lee, Hye Sun Lee, Da Jung Nam, Min Jung Kim, Na Young Kim, Hyung Seok Park",
