    "study_design": "Retrospective study",
    "inclusion_criteria": "Patients with breast cancer who underwent unilateral RNSM or CNSM with prepectoral IPBR using DTI or tissue expander between January 2018 and June 2020 at Severance Hospital, Seoul, Korea.",
